{
  "version": 1,
  "minor_version": 1,
  "key": "lovelace.dashboard_cameras",
  "data": {
    "config": {
      "views": [
        {
          "title": "All Cameras",
          "sections": [
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "custom:mushroom-template-card",
                  "entity": "sensor.perimeter_status",
                  "primary": "{{ states('sensor.perimeter_status') == 'Clear' and 'Perimeter clear' or states('sensor.perimeter_status') == 'Not clear' and 'Person detected' or 'Perimeter status unknown' }}",
                  "secondary": "{% if states(\"sensor.perimeter_status\") == \"Not clear\" %}Active: {{ state_attr(\"sensor.perimeter_status\", \"current_non_clear_camera\") }}{% else %}Last activity: {{ state_attr(\"sensor.perimeter_status\", \"last_non_clear_camera\") }}{% set since = state_attr(\"sensor.perimeter_status\", \"last_non_clear_since\") %}{% if since not in [none, \"unknown\"] %} · {{ relative_time(as_datetime(since)) }} ago{% endif %}{% endif %} · {{ state_attr(\"sensor.perimeter_status\", \"cameras_monitored\") }} cameras monitored{% set offline = state_attr(\"sensor.perimeter_status\", \"unavailable_cameras\") | int(0) %}{% if offline %} · {{ offline }} unavailable{% endif %}",
                  "icon": "{{ states('sensor.perimeter_status') == 'Clear' and 'mdi:shield-check' or states('sensor.perimeter_status') == 'Not clear' and 'mdi:shield-alert' or 'mdi:shield-off-outline' }}",
                  "icon_color": "{{ states('sensor.perimeter_status') == 'Clear' and 'green' or states('sensor.perimeter_status') == 'Not clear' and 'red' or 'amber' }}",
                  "multiline_secondary": true,
                  "fill_container": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "title": "Perimeter activity",
                  "content": "{% set cameras = [\n  dict(area='Front', camera='Doorbell', sensor='binary_sensor.reolink_video_doorbell_poe_person'),\n  dict(area='Front', camera='Garage Front', sensor='binary_sensor.garage_front_person'),\n  dict(area='West Path', camera='West', sensor='binary_sensor.west_person'),\n  dict(area='East Path', camera='East', sensor='binary_sensor.east_person'),\n  dict(area='Backyard', camera='Backyard', sensor='binary_sensor.backyard_person')\n] %}\n{% set active = cameras | selectattr('sensor', 'is_state', 'on') | list %}\n{% set offline = cameras | rejectattr('sensor', 'has_value') | list %}\n{% if active | count == 0 and offline | count == 0 %}\n## ✅ All areas clear\nNo person is currently detected by any perimeter camera.\n{% else %}\n{% if active | count > 0 %}\n## 🚨 {{ active | count }} active detection{{ 's' if active | count != 1 }}\n{% for item in active %}\n- **{{ item.area }} — {{ item.camera }}**  \n  Detected **{{ relative_time(states[item.sensor].last_changed) }} ago** · since {{ as_local(states[item.sensor].last_changed).strftime('%-I:%M:%S %p') }}\n{% endfor %}\n{% endif %}\n{% if offline | count > 0 %}\n## ⚠️ Coverage issue\n{% for item in offline %}\n- **{{ item.area }} — {{ item.camera }}:** {{ states(item.sensor) | title }}\n{% endfor %}\n{% endif %}\n{% endif %}\n\n_Last checked {{ now().strftime('%-I:%M %p') }} · updates automatically_"
                },
                {
                  "type": "glance",
                  "title": "Camera coverage",
                  "show_name": true,
                  "show_state": true,
                  "state_color": true,
                  "columns": 5,
                  "entities": [
                    {
                      "entity": "binary_sensor.reolink_video_doorbell_poe_person",
                      "name": "Front · Doorbell"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "binary_sensor.garage_front_person",
                      "name": "Front · Garage"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "binary_sensor.west_person",
                      "name": "West Path"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "binary_sensor.east_person",
                      "name": "East Path"
                    },
                    {
                      "entity": "binary_sensor.backyard_person",
                      "name": "Backyard"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "heading": "Front",
                  "heading_style": "title"
                },
                {
                  "show_state": true,
                  "show_name": false,
                  "camera_view": "live",
                  "fit_mode": "cover",
                  "type": "picture-entity",
                  "entity": "camera.garage_front_fluent",
                  "image": "https://demo.home-assistant.io/stub_config/bedroom.png"
                },
                {
                  "show_state": true,
                  "show_name": false,
                  "camera_view": "live",
                  "fit_mode": "cover",
                  "type": "picture-entity",
                  "entity": "camera.reolink_video_doorbell_poe_fluent",
                  "image": "https://demo.home-assistant.io/stub_config/bedroom.png"
                },
                {
